{"resourceIdentifier":"2693","resourceName":"Yizheng Zhongxing Recycled PET Project","description":"“Yizheng Zhongxing Recycled PET Project” (hereinafter called “the Project”) aims to produce the PET chips by using waste PET products (like consumed package and bottled drink, used cable, etc.) and to replace the same PET product produced from the raw materials. The Project located in No.1, Zhongxing Rd, Zhenzhou Town Industrial Concentration District, Yizheng, Jiangsu, China and is developed and operated by Yizheng Zhongxing Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd.\r\nPrior to the project implementation, the same amount of PET chips would be produced from raw materials (crude oil and natural gas) which is also the baseline scenario of the project. Therefore, the GHG emission reduction will be generated through the implementation of the project by avoiding the consumption of the equivalent raw materials and reducing related energy consumption as well.","location":{"latitude":32.297767,"longitude":119.123500},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-12-09","endExclusive":"2022-01-09","endInclusive":"2022-01-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2693"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yizheng Zhongxing Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2693"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59876"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.AJ."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type"